        <div id="collapseTwo" class="collapse" aria-labelledby="headingTwo" data-bs-parent="#accordion">
            <div class="card-body">
                <p data-location="aidevelopment-capabilities-paragraph1">At Avanti AI Innovators, we specialize in harnessing AI to revolutionize business processes, with a keen focus on streamlining paperwork-intensive operations. Our capabilities include:</p>

                <ul>
                    <li data-location="aidevelopment-capabilities-item1"><strong>AI-Driven Workflow Optimization:</strong> Leveraging decades of experience in enterprise content management and lean methodologies to create AI-powered workflows that drastically reduce manual labor and errors.</li>
                    <li data-location="aidevelopment-capabilities-item2"><strong>Custom AI Agents:</strong> Utilizing the Agency Swarm framework to develop tailored AI agents that automate complex tasks and decision-making processes.</li>
                    <li data-location="aidevelopment-capabilities-item3"><strong>Intelligent Document Processing:</strong> Combining our expertise in ECM systems with AI to transform how organizations handle, process, and extract value from their documents.</li>
                    <li data-location="aidevelopment-capabilities-item4"><strong>Open-Source AI Integration:</strong> Transitioning from proprietary models to cutting-edge open-source solutions like LLaMA 3.1 and NVIDIA NeMo, ensuring scalability and cost-effectiveness.</li>
                    <li data-location="aidevelopment-capabilities-item5"><strong>Web-Based AI Solutions:</strong> Crafting responsive, AI-integrated web applications using ASP.NET Core, providing intuitive interfaces for AI-human collaboration.</li>
                    <li data-location="aidevelopment-capabilities-item6"><strong>Legacy System Modernization:</strong> Applying AI to breathe new life into outdated systems, bridging the gap between traditional infrastructure and AI-powered futures.</li>
                    <li data-location="aidevelopment-capabilities-item7"><strong>Regulatory Compliance AI:</strong> Developing AI solutions that ensure adherence to complex regulatory frameworks, drawing from our experience with government agencies and highly regulated industries.</li>
                </ul>
